ReBushido
=========

What the licence covers
-----------------------
The file LICENSE (GNU Affero General Public License, version 3 or later)
covers the work made for this project: the tools, the tests, the build
files, the documentation, the names and comments in the source, and every
change ReBushido makes to the game. A release's ReBushidoPatcher.exe is
built from tools/patcher/ and is under the same licence; it is linked with
the start-up code of the mingw-w64 runtime and of GCC, whose own terms
allow that.

What it does not cover
----------------------
Bushido Blade 2 is the property of its rights holders (Square / Lightweight,
1998). The source in this repository is a reconstruction of that game's
program, written so that it compiles to the same bytes; the program's
behaviour and its data remain theirs. This repository contains none of the
game's assets (models, textures, sound, video, the disc image). To build a
playable disc you need your own copy of the game.

The PlayStation library code under src/main/psxsdk/, include/psxsdk/ and
movovl/sdk/ is a reconstruction of Sony's PsyQ libraries, which remain
Sony's.

This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Square Enix, Lightweight
or Sony Interactive Entertainment.

